        "html": "<figure class=\"case-flow-overview study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"d1\" style=\"margin:24px 0 34px;padding:20px 18px;background:#fbfcfa;border:1px solid #dce5df;border-radius:14px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-overview h3{font-size:23px!important;line-height:1.6!important;margin:0 0 9px!important;color:#244b48}.case-flow-overview p,.case-flow-overview figcaption{font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.8!important;color:#5c726e}.case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-overview svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;max-width:none;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif;color:#254c48}.case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:650;fill:#244b48}.case-flow-detail{font-size:15px;fill:#536b65}.case-flow-edge{font-size:15px;fill:#647a73;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fbfcfa;stroke-width:5px;stroke-linejoin:round}.case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#a6bbb3;stroke-width:1.5}.case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#246f63;stroke-width:3.5}.case-flow-node:hover rect{filter:brightness(.97)}.case-flow-overview figcaption{margin:12px 0 0!important}.case-flow-overview svg text{pointer-events:none}</style><h3>从钻进观测，到约束内的参数候选</h3><p>沿箭头阅读资料怎样流转；上下两条路线使用相同观测，判断分支将待核查情况单独保留。<span data-flow-instruction></span></p><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程图可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 640\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"从钻进观测，到约束内的参数候选：观测、处理、模型与基线、判断、复核、输出和对照\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-d1\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L7 3L0 6Z\" fill=\"#527c77\"/></marker></defs>\n <path d=\"M250 124H285\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"268\" y=\"90\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">原始观测</text><path d=\"M515 124H550\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"532\" y=\"90\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">特征</text><path d=\"M400 168V300H550\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"466\" y=\"285\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">同一输入</text><path d=\"M780 124H848V182\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"820\" y=\"102\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">候选</text><path d=\"M848 310V350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"890\" y=\"333\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">待核查</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 80)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"25\" fill=\"#eaf1ee\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">多井钻进记录</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">WOB / RPM / 流量 / ROP</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(285 80)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#edf2f6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">整井分组与标定</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">训练拟合尺度 · 验证选 λ</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(550 80)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#dcefe7\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">多变量钻速代理</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">回归系数 → 候选钻速</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(550 300)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f3eddf\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">简化钻速回归</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">同一留出井的基线</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"3\"><polygon points=\"848,182 963,246 848,310 733,246\" fill=\"#fff2d7\"/><text x=\"848\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">施工条件</text><text x=\"848\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">均满足？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(835 350)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f6e6db\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">排除不可行设置</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">检查参数边界与约束余量</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(835 470)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"25\" fill=\"#dcefe7\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">可行参数候选</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">搜索 2,145 点后的设置</text></g><g><rect x=\"20\" y=\"470\" width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#eef0f0\" stroke=\"#bcc7c5\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"503\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">留出评价资料</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"532\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">仅在对照环节读取</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"4\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(550 470)\"><rect width=\"230\" height=\"88\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#edf2f6\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">留出井误差对照</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">RMSE / MAE / 误差位置</text></g>\n <path d=\"M950 438V470\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a6764b\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"1006\" y=\"458\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">确认后</text><path d=\"M963 246H1080V514H1065\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"1035\" y=\"231\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">可继续</text><path d=\"M250 514H550\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"397\" y=\"500\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">独立参考</text><path d=\"M835 514H780\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"808\" y=\"500\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">输出</text><path d=\"M665 388V470\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#527c77\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-d1)\"/><text x=\"710\" y=\"435\" class=\"case-flow-edge\" text-anchor=\"middle\">同分母</text>\n </svg></div><figcaption>实线箭头连接计算与输出，虚线表示人工核查后的衔接。模型与基线的结果进入同条件对照；评价资料仅在评价环节使用。窄屏可左右滑动查看完整关系。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S1｜按整井分开数据</h3><div style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"按整井分开数据\"><rect width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f1f6f2\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"55\" width=\"245\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">8 口训练井 · 512 点</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"55\" width=\"245\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"341\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">3 口验证井 · 192 点</text><rect x=\"610\" y=\"55\" width=\"245\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"626\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">2 口测试井 · 128 点</text><path d=\"M100 150V225\" stroke=\"#107d76\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M145 150V225\" stroke=\"#107d76\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M190 150V225\" stroke=\"#107d76\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M390 150V225\" stroke=\"#c7954d\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M440 150V225\" stroke=\"#c7954d\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M680 150V225\" stroke=\"#648bb0\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M735 150V225\" stroke=\"#648bb0\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">同一口井的记录只属于一个集合；测试井不参与拟合与选择。</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>输入：13 口教学井的工况与钻速；动作：8 口训练、3 口验证、2 口测试；保留整井身份；产物：512 / 192 / 128 条记录。随机拆散同井样本会低估迁移难度。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S2｜拟合一个可解释的钻速代理</h3><div style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"拟合一个可解释的钻速代理\"><rect width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f1f6f2\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\"><path d=\"M80 220L600 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#17343f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M80 220L80 55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#17343f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M90 210Q310 45 590 85\" stroke=\"#107d76\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"180\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#c7954d\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"151\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#c7954d\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"112\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#c7954d\"/><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"99\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#c7954d\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"83\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#c7954d\"/><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"76\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#c7954d\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#17343f\">10 个输入特征</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17343f\">β 从训练井学习</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#17343f\">惩罚过大的系数</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">真实求解 β；没有预存预测表。</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>输入：训练井 WOB、RPM、Q、UCS 和 ROP；动作：训练集标准化，使用一次项、平方项和交互项拟合岭回归；产物：冻结标准化参数与回归系数。系数说明统计关系，不能直接当作因果效应。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S3｜用验证井选择正则强度</h3><div style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"用验证井选择正则强度\"><rect width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f1f6f2\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">λ = 0.01</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"266\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">λ = 0.1</text><rect x=\"460\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"476\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">λ = 1</text><rect x=\"670\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"686\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">λ = 10</text><rect x=\"87\" y=\"135\" width=\"95\" height=\"80\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><rect x=\"297\" y=\"132\" width=\"95\" height=\"83\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#78aa95\"/><rect x=\"507\" y=\"114\" width=\"95\" height=\"101\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#78aa95\"/><rect x=\"717\" y=\"87\" width=\"95\" height=\"128\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#78aa95\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">图中高度示意比较方式；演示下方显示本次实际 RMSE。</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>输入：4 个候选 λ 与同一验证集；动作：分别计算验证 RMSE，保留误差最小的模型；产物：λ、4 个验证分数和基线系数。测试指标只报告，不反过来自动选择模型。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S4｜在可行域内搜索参数</h3><div style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"在可行域内搜索参数\"><rect width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f1f6f2\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\"><rect x=\"35\" y=\"40\" width=\"245\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">2,145 个参数点</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"40\" width=\"245\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"346\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">约束逐项检查</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"40\" width=\"245\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"641\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">按预测 ROP 排序</text><path d=\"M80 190H790\" stroke=\"#17343f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M500 125V245\" stroke=\"#cc654f\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"190\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"177\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"164\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"225\" cy=\"151\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"190\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"315\" cy=\"177\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"164\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"405\" cy=\"151\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"190\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#107d76\"/><circle cx=\"495\" cy=\"177\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"164\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><circle cx=\"585\" cy=\"151\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><circle cx=\"630\" cy=\"190\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><circle cx=\"675\" cy=\"177\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><circle cx=\"720\" cy=\"164\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><circle cx=\"765\" cy=\"151\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cc654f\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">左侧合格点进入排序；被排除点保留具体原因。</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>输入：冻结代理 + WOB/RPM/Q 网格与 5 项约束；动作：逐点预测 ROP；计算泵压、扭矩；排序合格点；产物：2,145 点、可行点计数与候选设置。关闭约束后仍显示违反项；不能隐藏代价。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>图 S5｜比较留出误差，留下复核依据</h3><div style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"比较留出误差，留下复核依据\"><rect width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f1f6f2\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"40\" width=\"250\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">模型 / 单 WOB 基线</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"40\" width=\"250\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"346\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">同 128 点计算误差</text><rect x=\"620\" y=\"40\" width=\"240\" height=\"60\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d7eae2\"/><text x=\"636\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">人工复核另存</text><path d=\"M80 210L820 210\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#17343f\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><path d=\"M170 210V150\" stroke=\"#107d76\" stroke-width=\"16\"/><path d=\"M260 210V100\" stroke=\"#c7954d\" stroke-width=\"16\"/><path d=\"M440 210V170\" stroke=\"#107d76\" stroke-width=\"16\"/><path d=\"M530 210V130\" stroke=\"#c7954d\" stroke-width=\"16\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#17343f\">输入改变 → 结果待重算；重算完成 → 才能导出当前结果。</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>输入：两口测试井与冻结推荐点；动作：同数据比较多变量模型与单 WOB 基线；推荐冻结后再计算教学实现值；产物：RMSE、MAE、误差位置、约束余量与人工记录。代理高估的点要检查；模拟实现值与代理预测分列。</figcaption></figure>"
      }
    },
    "demo": {
      "mode": "page",
      "html": "demo/index.html",
      "js": "demo/demo.js",
      "label": "可运行示范",
      "height": 1100,
      "intro": "从多口教学井学习钻速响应，比较单钻压经验基线，再在钻压、转速、流量、泵压与扭矩边界内搜索参数。你可以收紧约束、放大噪声，或进入更硬地层的迁移情景。"
    }
  }
}
